{"ticker":"PETRONET","symbol":"PETRONET","instrumentId":3023099,"name":"Petronetlng","industry":"NSE-Oil&Gas-Refining/Mktg","about":"Petronet LNG Ltd. is a leading company in India’s LNG infrastructure, focusing on the import, storage, and regasification of liquefied natural gas (LNG). Established as a joint venture by four major Oil & Gas public sector companies—ONGC, IOCL, GAIL, and BPCL—Petronet plays a vital role in meeting India’s increasing energy demands. The company operates a major LNG regasification terminal at Dahej and is expanding operations with a greenfield terminal at Kochi. With a balanced ownership between public sector entities and institutional investors, Petronet is a cornerstone in India’s energy supply chain, ensuring energy security through efficient LNG infrastructure.","website":"www.petronetlng.in","location":"New Delhi, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:48:34.170Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":330.8,"changePct":1.6282642089093735,"week52High":335,"week52Low":238.05},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹49,620 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹33,366 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"750,000,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"783"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"602,854,149"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"3.02%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"2.23"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"2.3"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.09"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.29"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"5%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"10.71"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"9–15"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"17.6%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"31.67"},{"label":"Volume","value":"3,245,484"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"2,588,448"},{"label":"Master score","value":"68"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"77"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"79"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"111"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating","value":"A-"}